    "q": "Can I use my brand font in an AI image?",
    "a": "Not by rendering. The engines take a prompt and source pictures, not a font file, so they draw letters in a style you describe. For exact brand type, set the line in your own design file, export it as a transparent PNG and place it on the picture in the Image editor, the same way you'd place a logo."
